r strategy online.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/643980/extras/a6488c6ca953dc39db1b2edc122ed0bf.poster.avif?t=1791043369\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/643980/extras/a6488c6ca953dc39db1b2edc122ed0bf.webm?t=1791043369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/643980/extras/a6488c6ca953dc39db1b2edc122ed0bf.mp4?t=1791043369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FREE TO PLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ironbound is free to play. Character upgrades and combat equipment are earned through play; optional purchases are cosmetic skins for your hero’s crest and the Supporter Pack, which places a Supporter badge beside your name on the ladder. Nothing you can buy makes your hero stronger. Your advantage comes from understanding the classes, choosing your equipment and knowing how to use it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/643980/extras/66edf7f0a65eabd40d6c839f730e4af0.poster.avif?t=1791043369\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/643980/extras/66edf7f0a65eabd40d6c839f730e4af0.webm?t=1791043369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/643980/extras/66edf7f0a65eabd40d6c839f730e4af0.mp4?t=1791043369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
